      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="slide combined-axiology" data-title="Instruction · Axiology and values" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="slide-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Instruction</p>
        <div class="problem-strip" data-en="Research problem: Ten students were absent from yesterday’s research methods class." data-zh="研究問題：昨天的研究方法課有十名學生缺席。">Research problem: Ten students were absent from yesterday’s research methods class.</div>
        <h2 data-en="Axiology runs through the whole study" data-zh="價值論貫穿整項研究">Axiology runs through the whole study</h2>
        <div class="combined-values">
          <div class="continuum-reflection">
            <h3 data-en="Good research should be completely objective and value-free." data-zh="好的研究應完全客觀，並且不受價值影響。">Good research should be completely objective and value-free.</h3>
            <div class="continuum">
              <label><span data-en="Strongly disagree" data-zh="非常不同意">Strongly disagree</span><span data-en="Strongly agree" data-zh="非常同意">Strongly agree</span></label>
              <input type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Position on values continuum" />
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="question-list compact">
            <p data-en="Who decided that absence is a problem?" data-zh="誰決定缺席是一個問題？">Who decided that absence is a problem?</p>
            <p data-en="Whose interests would the study serve?" data-zh="研究會服務誰的利益？">Whose interests would the study serve?</p>
            <p data-en="Could the researcher’s position affect interpretation?" data-zh="研究者的位置會影響詮釋嗎？">Could the researcher’s position affect interpretation?</p>
            <p data-en="Is attempting neutrality itself a value position?" data-zh="嘗試保持中立本身也是一種價值立場嗎？">Is attempting neutrality itself a value position?</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="plain-row">
          <div><b data-en="Priorities" data-zh="優先次序">Priorities</b><span data-en="What deserves study?" data-zh="甚麼值得研究？">What deserves study?</span></div>
          <div><b data-en="Position" data-zh="研究者位置">Position</b><span data-en="How am I implicated?" data-zh="我如何牽涉其中？">How am I implicated?</span></div>
          <div><b data-en="Power" data-zh="權力">Power</b><span data-en="Whose voice counts?" data-zh="誰的聲音被重視？">Whose voice counts?</span></div>
          <div><b data-en="Consequences" data-zh="後果">Consequences</b><span data-en="Who benefits or loses?" data-zh="誰受益或受損？">Who benefits or loses?</span></div>
        </div>
        <p class="instruction" data-en="Values can be made transparent and examined. They cannot simply be switched off." data-zh="價值可以被透明呈現與檢視，卻不能被簡單關掉。">Values can be made transparent and examined. They cannot simply be switched off.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="slide" data-title="Activity · Match paradigms and questions" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="slide-inner">
        <p class="eyebrow">Activity</p>
        <div class="problem-strip" data-en="Research problem: Ten students were absent from yesterday’s research methods class." data-zh="研究問題：昨天的研究方法課有十名學生缺席。">Research problem: Ten students were absent from yesterday’s research methods class.</div>
        <h2 data-en="Match each paradigm to its research question" data-zh="把每個典範配對到其研究問題">Match each paradigm to its research question</h2>
        <p class="note matching-note" data-en="Choose a paradigm on the left, then choose the question on the right that best follows from its assumptions." data-zh="先在左側選擇一個典範，再在右側選擇最能體現其假設的研究問題。">Choose a paradigm on the left, then choose the question on the right that best follows from its assumptions.</p>
        <div class="matching-activity" data-matching-activity>
          <div class="matching-column">
            <h3 data-en="Paradigms" data-zh="典範">Paradigms</h3>
            <button type="button" class="match-paradigm" data-match-paradigm="positivism" data-en="Positivism" data-zh="實證主義">Positivism</button>
            <button type="button" class="match-paradigm" data-match-paradigm="postpositivism" data-en="Post-Positivism" data-zh="後實證主義">Post-Positivism</button>
            <button type="button" class="match-paradigm" data-match-paradigm="interpretivism" data-en="Interpretivism / Constructivism" data-zh="解釋主義／建構主義">Interpretivism / Constructivism</button>
            <button type="button" class="match-paradigm" data-match-paradigm="critical-realism" data-en="Critical Realism" data-zh="批判現實主義">Critical Realism</button>
            <button type="button" class="match-paradigm" data-match-paradigm="pragmatism" data-en="Pragmatism" data-zh="實用主義">Pragmatism</button>
          </div>
          <div class="matching-column matching-questions">
            <h3 data-en="Research questions" data-zh="研究問題">Research questions</h3>
            <button type="button" class="match-question" data-match-question="pragmatism" data-en="Which feasible response improves attendance, for whom and under what conditions?" data-zh="哪些可行回應能改善出席？對誰有效？在甚麼條件下有效？">Which feasible response improves attendance, for whom and under what conditions?</button>
            <button type="button" class="match-question" data-match-question="interpretivism" data-en="How do students understand and explain their decisions to miss this class?" data-zh="學生如何理解和解釋自己缺席這節課的決定？">How do students understand and explain their decisions to miss this class?</button>
            <button type="button" class="match-question" data-match-question="postpositivism" data-en="Which factors predict absence, and how confidently can we make that claim?" data-zh="哪些因素能預測缺席？我們能以多大把握提出這個主張？">Which factors predict absence, and how confidently can we make that claim?</button>
            <button type="button" class="match-question" data-match-question="critical-realism" data-en="What underlying conditions and mechanisms may be producing these absences?" data-zh="哪些深層條件與機制可能產生這些缺席？">What underlying conditions and mechanisms may be producing these absences?</button>
            <button type="button" class="match-question" data-match-question="positivism" data-en="Which measurable factors are associated with absence in this class?" data-zh="哪些可測量因素與這節課的缺席有關？">Which measurable factors are associated with absence in this class?</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="matching-feedback" data-matching-feedback aria-live="polite"></div>
        <button type="button" class="reset-position" data-matching-reset data-en="Reset matches" data-zh="重設配對">Reset matches</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="slide" data-title="How-to · Align a research design" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="slide-inner design-walkthrough">
        <p class="eyebrow">How-to</p>
        <div class="problem-strip" data-en="Research problem: Ten students were absent from yesterday’s research methods class." data-zh="研究問題：昨天的研究方法課有十名學生缺席。">Research problem: Ten students were absent from yesterday’s research methods class.</div>
        <h2 data-en="Make every connection visible" data-zh="讓每個連繫清晰可見">Make every connection visible</h2>
        <div class="design-walkthrough-grid">
          <figure class="thinking-map"><img src={thinkingMapSrc} alt="Research design thinking map showing purpose, paradigm, design and frame" /><figcaption data-en="A research design is a chain of connected decisions, not a set of separate boxes." data-zh="研究設計是一連串彼此相連的決策，而不是一組分開的方格。">A research design is a chain of connected decisions, not a set of separate boxes.</figcaption></figure>
          <ol class="thinker-steps">
            <li><b data-en="Purpose" data-zh="目的">Purpose</b><p data-en="‘First, I need to understand whether yesterday’s absences were unusual and what may be shaping them.’" data-zh="「首先，我需要了解昨天的缺席是否不尋常，以及甚麼因素可能形塑它。」">‘First, I need to understand whether yesterday’s absences were unusual and what may be shaping them.’</p></li>
            <li><b data-en="Paradigm" data-zh="典範">Paradigm</b><p data-en="‘The absences are observable, but students may experience their causes differently. I need both patterns and accounts.’" data-zh="「缺席是可觀察的，但學生可能以不同方式經驗其原因。我需要規律和敘述兩方面的證據。」">‘The absences are observable, but students may experience their causes differently. I need both patterns and accounts.’</p></li>
            <li><b data-en="Refined question" data-zh="聚焦後的問題">Refined question</b><p data-en="‘How do timetable, workload and student circumstances combine to shape absence from this class?’" data-zh="「時間表、工作量與學生處境如何共同形塑這節課的缺席？」">‘How do timetable, workload and student circumstances combine to shape absence from this class?’</p></li>
            <li><b data-en="Design" data-zh="設計">Design</b><p data-en="‘A small mixed-methods case study can first identify attendance patterns, then explore how students explain them.’" data-zh="「小型混合方法個案研究可先辨識出席規律，再探究學生如何解釋它們。」">‘A small mixed-methods case study can first identify attendance patterns, then explore how students explain them.’</p></li>
            <li><b data-en="Methods" data-zh="研究方法">Methods</b><p data-en="‘I will examine several weeks of records, invite an anonymous questionnaire, and interview volunteers without treating absence as misconduct.’" data-zh="「我會檢視數週的紀錄，邀請學生填寫匿名問卷，並訪談自願者；不把缺席預設為違規。」">‘I will examine several weeks of records, invite an anonymous questionnaire, and interview volunteers without treating absence as misconduct.’</p></li>
            <li><b data-en="Analysis and claims" data-zh="分析與主張">Analysis and claims</b><p data-en="‘I will compare patterns with students’ accounts and make a cautious claim about this class—not a universal causal claim.’" data-zh="「我會把規律與學生敘述作比較，並對這個班級提出審慎主張，而不是提出普遍的因果主張。」">‘I will compare patterns with students’ accounts and make a cautious claim about this class—not a universal causal claim.’</p></li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="slide" data-title="Exit · Exit ticket" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="slide-inner exit-slide">
        <div class="exit-head">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">Exit</p><h2 data-en="What is clearer now?" data-zh="現在有甚麼更清晰？">What is clearer now?</h2></div>
          <div class="view-switch" role="tablist"><button type="button" class="is-active" data-exit-view="student" data-en="Student form" data-zh="學生表格">Student form</button><button type="button" data-exit-view="teacher" data-en="Teacher dashboard" data-zh="教師儀表板">Teacher dashboard</button></div>
        </div>

        <section data-exit-panel="student">
          <form class="exit-form" data-exit-form>
            <div class="identity-row">
              <label><span data-en="Nickname or preferred name" data-zh="暱稱或慣用名字">Nickname or preferred name</span><input name="preferredName" maxlength="60" required autocomplete="nickname" /></label>
              <label><span data-en="Class code" data-zh="班級代碼">Class code</span><input name="classCode" maxlength="40" required autocapitalize="characters" /></label>
            </div>
            <div class="exit-grid">
              {exitQuestions.map(([name, en, zh]) => (
                <label><span data-en={en} data-zh={zh}>{en}</span><textarea name={name} data-save={name} rows="2"></textarea></label>
              ))}
            </div>
